the tournament - an impressive achievement - you still only get the
same points as someone who ascended two roles, just one after the
other.

This means that your clan score can go *DOWN* after an ascension. If I
have a Birdie with bells (say... Lawful Fem Human Samurai, Neutral
Gnomish Male Healer) for example... then I have won 6 points for my
clan. If, later in the tournament I then ascend a Chaotic Elven Wizard,
then I will have won the Double Top worth 4 points.

But if I'd just stopped after the first two ascensions I'd have six
points.

I just find it a little strange that having more ascensions can
actually decrease your score.

